# RESPOND MSG is never logged, so the action: lines pin each step. The BlocksScreen print-control buttons: PAUSE parks on the bucket, RESUME re-heats, purges, wipes, CANCEL_PRINT parks.
# CI_EXPECT_LOG: Parking toolhead on bucket
# CI_EXPECT_LOG: action:paused
# CI_EXPECT_LOG: action:resumed
# CI_EXPECT_LOG: action:cancel
# CI_EXPECT_LOG: Raising z height by 15
CONFIG ../../ci.cfg
DICTIONARY mcu.dict Toolhead=Toolhead.dict pi=pi.dict beacon=beacon.dict
CI_SET_FILAMENT PRESENT=1
G28
M109 S210
G90
G1 X250 Y250 Z5 F6000
M83
G1 X260 E2 F1800
PAUSE
RESUME
G1 X250 E2 F1800
CANCEL_PRINT
